   ["It's been slow-cooked, with rosemary.","Foi cozinhado lentamente, com alecrim.","4c7ee99d-d373-449b-af3b-8753c5c96d53","4cbb454f-ba33-4996-ad05-5dcf55bd3f8a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S09": [
   ["I'll have the lamb, please.","Eu vou querer o borrego, por favor.","dc38313c-b001-41cb-95ef-67bdaa49b7c9","86ce35e2-47d1-42d8-b449-dcca614915f5"],
   ["With a side of greens.","Com um acompanhamento de legumes verdes.","bd3ce971-b135-4254-bf65-c876b6672b0b","52628b2b-3614-4e17-a0d8-1f7e00eb378b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S10": [
   ["And the risotto for me.","E para mim o risoto.","0ab13c8c-60dc-46a1-a2e0-05939a8a206e","1dc59589-0973-460f-a5d8-3aab94e1ff45"],
   ["With a small green salad to start.","Com uma pequena salada verde para começar.","70fb684a-eed0-4494-ae67-5e3693ac68d1","101cbf29-8575-4768-adcf-cf96a9ee9530"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S11": [
   ["Of course.","Com certeza.","73e1ade0-040c-4d28-a285-138a727f1253","968bb2f9-7788-41a8-96e4-211b28fc950d"],
   ["And what would you like to drink?","E o que desejam beber?","fda6d28c-2fff-436f-8ff7-2216faa48f38","844b8cec-df4a-4aa2-83d0-a8a5a17ce816"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S14": [
   ["Excellent choice.","Excelente escolha.","56d7746a-237a-49bc-be1e-f6452fbbb0e7","8e47d9c3-8abc-4186-bbf6-ac87da5e6516"],
   ["I'll bring it right over.","Já a trago num instante.","9bc615d5-cc29-4f18-9644-108ef9da1f8d","8c372097-8205-437d-bae0-4186743ad8a4"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S15": [
   ["Is everything alright?","Está tudo bem?","23266310-e53f-4e74-bb89-2a6e5edda66b","c57cbdc0-1046-42b5-809a-f25507e98eaf"],
   ["Do you have any room for dessert?","Têm espaço para sobremesa?","df370956-ad47-4c90-90e2-96f3720ad1b3","c32d1ece-a1c8-4a6a-a20a-e1822115ae7b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S16": [
   ["Just two coffees, please.","Só dois cafés, por favor.","1b4795de-9cab-44ac-bf10-bdf2871e639c","0153b952-9b8d-40b0-9b60-0e667db247a7"],
   ["Decaf for me.","Descafeinado para mim.","c1dc2e72-fda3-49bd-8ea0-a1cf6d02e0ee","d52de30f-5286-4d4e-8a87-356db02a7fef"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC09-S17": [
   ["And the bill, when you're ready.","E a conta, quando puder.","2e348068-1608-4110-be5b-fc7b194533dc","66c2c5f1-fb9f-4a45-9c3f-e0913e5688db"],
   ["Could we split it?","Podíamos dividi-la?","7876bf13-7cb4-4435-a8c2-195200bded48","994ac5e1-acec-46dc-9de6-825f954d5040"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S01": [
   ["Excuse me.","Desculpe.","4d35ce53-4b8e-465f-b7a9-b95426abe3f8","38cd25af-e9be-4622-8ad7-0472fde4d4c6"],
   ["Do you have any painkillers?","Tem analgésicos?","ef9a5855-5c1c-410b-bdcf-ab14fb36c925","1d23cf2c-fb69-4e82-81de-0bf11d039396"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S03": [
   ["Thank you.","Obrigado.","e8c75798-5ad0-47f4-926d-48a88505f3d8","8cba2c0e-0fd3-4aad-be75-6246d9c0b0a4"],
   ["And do you have any painkillers for children?","E tem analgésicos para crianças?","92a7c00c-c8e9-447d-b822-048ead6c3a43","b2a934fa-4988-48b5-917f-f917356e2be2"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S04": [
   ["I think so,","Penso que sim,","083c1b13-324a-46db-9451-ad584921519f","83c511ba-d0b8-490d-8977-9979993c467c"],
   ["but you'll have to look to make sure.","mas tem de procurar para ter a certeza.","82613111-5337-40a3-ab31-a9c5c8584196","f755e6cf-2ac1-49e6-a0dd-95a7369fa002"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S05": [
   ["I also need to get","Também preciso de comprar","645d7a51-1d92-4954-96a4-6d0d23a37e58","c1f2dbc5-f06f-4899-95fe-13d3b704dd18"],
   ["some sunscreen","protetor solar","5e81547f-c90c-4e15-9072-7365fd047989","26a478e4-b736-45e5-9d73-cb37ef67b3c8"],
   ["and some toothpaste.","e pasta de dentes.","aee53ccf-1f3f-49d4-989c-96606684c866","719d80ee-3305-43f7-b450-98854a73aa1a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S06": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","O protetor solar está ali à sua direita,","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","5811e098-ecd3-4a6f-9c84-48dadbe88dcc"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","e a pasta de dentes encontra-a logo ao virar da esquina.","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","833e2a38-a044-4a12-bf26-5659fb4ba635"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S07": [
   ["Thank you, you've been very helpful.","Obrigado, ajudou-me imenso.","73098d09-784b-4315-9ee0-5a72f5eb7497","8708a8bd-653c-4c17-ab0c-69f3f95402ba"],
   ["I'm very grateful.","Estou muito grato.","183c9aab-6cc8-4ef7-a550-78a8a5054418","f3e9207d-bbaf-4dcb-a324-61a2dbdfaa1f"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S08": [
   ["You're welcome.","De nada.","5d55041c-5685-48c7-9859-fde2677a459f","6cb74085-4894-421c-8d65-edef8242d061"],
   ["Are you here on holiday?","Está aqui de férias?","909170cd-510c-4d58-8f30-89233fe84c43","6a12ed6d-a67f-495b-969d-8c5c94e2b8d7"],
   ["You speak very good English.","Fala muito bem inglês.","d930f751-8149-409f-995b-67eb885cda2c","dc181220-334e-45a0-8278-694a0f7a8771"]
  ],
  "eng_for_por:pod-1:SC10-S09": [
   ["That's very kind of you!","É muito amável da sua parte!","c2c7822d-85f6-4eea-9869-edd3f40db30f","42e0b50b-2692-46d7-b94d-ba973c486594"],
   ["Yes, I'm on holiday,","Sim, estou de férias","de432528-dcca-4ce7-83d7-9b34da210201","580326a9-2a5f-4dcf-aa25-49930ccdf158"],
   ["and I need to practice more","e preciso de praticar mais","4d2b0867-925e-4aad-bb73-da9b5cae2843","528d7ca2-9ee7-496a-98d5-1caf38dbc2b6"],
   ["to speak English better.","para falar melhor inglês.","a69b525a-18c7-4c5c-9fe5-feaba6e1cc9f","c8981837-70be-4154-97e4-bbf64699556f"],
   ["Thank you very much, and goodbye.","Muito obrigado e adeus.","9dbc5c36-be61-49de-91f1-b5901009c321","3ab51475-c4b7-4394-b8f0-2cad45870ed1"]
